/T (This document describes the design and implementation of Milestone 3 of the Lab Resource Utilization Platform, developed as part of an internship project. It is intended to give a mentor or reviewer a clear, code-grounded picture of what was built, how the pieces fit together, and how each module can be verified against the source code.)
/E (This document describes the design and implementation of Milestone 3 of the Lab Resource Utilization Platform, developed as part of an internship project. It is intended to give a mentor or reviewer a clear, code-grounded picture of what was built, how the pieces fit together, and how each module can be verified against the source code.)
