195 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 151 0 R
/T (The Lab Resource Utilization Platform is a web-based system built to help academic institutions manage, monitor, and optimize the usage of shared laboratory equipment. It brings equipment booking, maintenance, calibration, certification tracking, cost accounting, and analytics into a single role-aware application, replacing manual spreadsheets and disconnected processes with a live, auditable system.)
/E (The Lab Resource Utilization Platform is a web-based system built to help academic institutions manage, monitor, and optimize the usage of shared laboratory equipment. It brings equipment booking, maintenance, calibration, certification tracking, cost accounting, and analytics into a single role-aware application, replacing manual spreadsheets and disconnected processes with a live, auditable system.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
196 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 151 0 R
/T (The platform is built as a two-tier web application: a Spring Boot REST API backend backed by a PostgreSQL database, and a React single-page application frontend. Access is secured with JWT-based authentication and enforced per endpoint through Spring Security role checks, so every screen and every API call respects the signed-in user's role.)
/E (The platform is built as a two-tier web application: a Spring Boot REST API backend backed by a PostgreSQL database, and a React single-page application frontend. Access is secured with JWT-based authentication and enforced per endpoint through Spring Security role checks, so every screen and every API call respects the signed-in user's role.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
