/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 166 0 R
/T (Milestone 3 successfully extends the Lab Resource Utilization Platform with a connected set of operational modules: equipment maintenance and work orders, calibration and certification tracking, automated usage-based cost management with department-level allocation, role-based analytics, utilization/cost reporting, and a scheduled notification system. Each module is backed by dedicated JPA entities, Spring Data repositories, service-layer business logic, and role-restricted REST endpoints, with a matching React page and role-aware navigation on the frontend.)
/E (Milestone 3 successfully extends the Lab Resource Utilization Platform with a connected set of operational modules: equipment maintenance and work orders, calibration and certification tracking, automated usage-based cost management with department-level allocation, role-based analytics, utilization/cost reporting, and a scheduled notification system. Each module is backed by dedicated JPA entities, Spring Data repositories, service-layer business logic, and role-restricted REST endpoints, with a matching React page and role-aware navigation on the frontend.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
533 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 166 0 R
/T (Most importantly, the modules are not siloed: the EquipmentStatusScheduler ties maintenance, calibration/certification, cost generation, and notifications into a single recurring operational loop, giving the platform the kind of automated day-to-day upkeep a real multi-institution lab-sharing system needs. This provides a solid foundation for the analytics, reporting, and billing features that later milestones can build further upon.)
/E (Most importantly, the modules are not siloed: the EquipmentStatusScheduler ties maintenance, calibration/certification, cost generation, and notifications into a single recurring operational loop, giving the platform the kind of automated day-to-day upkeep a real multi-institution lab-sharing system needs. This provides a solid foundation for the analytics, reporting, and billing features that later milestones can build further upon.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
