/Title (Most importantly, the modules are not siloed: the EquipmentStatusScheduler ties maintenance, calibration/certification, cost generation, and notifications into a single recurring operational loop, giving the platform the kind of automated day-to-day upkeep a real multi-institution lab-sharing system needs. This provides a solid foundation for the analytics, reporting, and billing features that later milestones can build further upon.)
