/Title (The platform is built as a two-tier web application: a Spring Boot REST API backend backed by a PostgreSQL database, and a React single-page application frontend. Access is secured with JWT-based authentication and enforced per endpoint through Spring Security role checks, so every screen and every API call respects the signed-in user's role.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 787 0 R
/Prev 881 0 R
/Next 882 0 R
>>
