/Title (After JWT-based login, ProtectedRoute checks the user's role \(stored in sessionStorage\) against each route's allowedRoles list before rendering MainLayout, which wraps every page with the Sidebar and Navbar. The Sidebar independently re-checks role permissions to decide which links to display, so navigation options always match what the backend will actually authorize.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 884 0 R
>>
